000100*================================================================
000200* RDCPR  COMMERCIAL PROPERTY RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE CPR.
000400*        USED BY RATCPR01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  CONSTRUCTION    A NON-COMBUSTIBLE, B MIXED, C COMBUSTIBLE
000900*  SPRINKLERED     Y = SPRINKLERS FITTED
001000*  TRADE-CODE      SIC-STYLE TRADE CODE
001100*  FLOOR-AREA      SQUARE METRES
001200*  VACANT          Y = PREMISES VACANT
001300*================================================================
001400 01  WS-CPR-DETAIL.
001500     05  WS-CONSTRUCTION          PIC X(01).
001600     05  WS-SPRINKLERED           PIC X(01).
001700     05  WS-TRADE-CODE            PIC 9(04).
001800     05  WS-FLOOR-AREA            PIC 9(07).
001900     05  WS-VACANT                PIC X(01).
002000     05  FILLER                  PIC X(46).
